    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909170/extras/734736c8ff9cd8126cbec02d5ad89b66.avif?t=1721723162\" width=620 height=90 /></span><br>In 2067, the ongoing low birth rate problem and household debt become a big problem around the world. <br>To solve this problem, the leaders of each country come up with new ideas.<br>It's called the Body Pay system.<br>This story is about a young Japanese person who is conducting a test bed prior to the application of the Body Pay system.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909170/extras/e5aba75d455dca62d76fbbf87571acab.avif?t=1721723162\" width=620 height=90 /></span><br>Body Pay is a casual puzzle game where you pay for products brought by supermarket customers by pressing the appropriate control keys.<br>As you move up the stage, overcome the increasing number of products and customer interruptions to achieve the target score and continue your secret story with the girls.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909170/extras/e0b9046852bee3aced6d06fee62ee3c2.poster.avif?t=1721723162\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909170/extras/e0b9046852bee3aced6d06fee62ee3c2.webm?t=1721723162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909170/extras/e0b9046852bee3aced6d06fee62ee3c2.mp4?t=1721723162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2909170/extras/397ea5f54d8c10fae424df3fab06bcbf.avif?t=1721723162\" width=620 height=90 /></span><br>Full v